Subject: Its crates on kiln's one hyper-raft and aws-lc-rs
Why: kiln holds one copy of each hyper-light product and of aws-lc-rs (CP-M1's one revision): Mantle's crates take hyper-raft's crates by path from Mantle's own vendor/, which kiln leaves out, so each path points at kiln's vendor/hyper-raft; Mantle's [patch.crates-io] points aws-lc-rs at kiln's vendor/aws-lc-rs (1.18.2 with Mantle's changes) and leaves aws-lc-sys crates.io's (0.46.0); its Cargo.lock is resolved on them

